      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788243228394,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Requirements\n1. 1:1 access token per package, a user can deposit or pick multiple packages\n2. supports exact size matches - xs, s, m, l, xl\n3. otp mathcing for pickup, otp generating service out of scope, payment service, \npricing, location service notification out of scope\n4. driver should come again if desried slots are filled\n5. A locker is emptied manually, otp refreshes in 7 days",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Requirements\n1. 1:1 access token per package, a user can deposit or pick multiple packages\n2. supports exact size matches - xs, s, m, l, xl\n3. otp mathcing for pickup, otp generating service out of scope, payment service, \npricing, location service notification out of scope\n4. driver should come again if desried slots are filled\n5. A locker is emptied manually, otp refreshes in 7 days",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
